      "stop_reason": "agent_finished",
      "final_text": "All four tests now pass. I fixed four defects in `src/inventory/`:\n\n- **`models.py`:** `Reservation.active()` had its comparison reversed (`now >= expires_at`). It now returns `now < expires_at`, so a reservation holds stock only before it expires.\n- **`store.py`, `reserve`:** The stock check compared against total stock. It now compares against `available(sku)`, so active reservations count against the limit and `OutOfStock` is raised correctly.\n- **`store.py`, `commit`:** An expired reservation could be committed. It now raises `KeyError` for an expired reservation without changing stock. The docstring requires this, but no test covers it.\n- **`store.py`, `release`:** It raised `KeyError` for unknown or already-released ids. It now uses `pop(rid, None)`, so repeated or unknown releases are ignored.",
